     A* WZC1P - First Health Claims Ack - Header Data
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 05/24/2006 by C:163 for Project 139MCV from client 139
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Purpose: This file will house the acknowledgement header record
     A*          It will be tied to the WZC9P record via C1NAME.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PC101                     TEXT('First Health Claims Ack +
     A                                            - Header Data')
     A            C1TYPE    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Record Type')
     A            C1PCDT    R               REFFLD(DT8)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Cycle Date')
     A            C1TRDT    R               REFFLD(DT8)
     A                                      COLHDG('Dte Transmission Snt')
     A            C1TRID    R               REFFLD(DS9)
     A                                      COLHDG('Transmission ID')
     A            C1REJT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Reject Indicator')
     A            C1FILL       163A
     A                                      COLHDG('Filler')
     A            C1DCID    R               REFFLD(DCID)
     A                                      COLHDG('Import Doc ID')
     A            C1MBR#    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('WZC0P Member #')
     A            C1PRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Processed Date')
     A            C1PRFL    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Processed Flag')
     A*
     A*                                     *blank = not processed yet
     A*                                     "D" = Deleted
     A*                                     "E" = Error
     A*                                     "R" = Recon
     A*                                     "Y" = written to WCMC
     A*
